{"id":"486d4a31c44186af","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-veblen-hierarchy.md","title":"Veblen Hierarchy Proposition","display":"thm-veblen-hierarchy — Veblen Hierarchy Proposition","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-veblen-hierarchy","aliases":["72-thm-veblen-hierarchy"],"display":"thm-veblen-hierarchy — Veblen Hierarchy Proposition","depends_on":["[[72-df-veblen-function]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Local derivation in ZFC; book background Ch.IV §1.1, print210–214; PDF222–226","verification_status":"source-and-argument-reviewed","proof_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-veblen-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-veblen-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-veblen-hierarchy — Veblen Hierarchy Proposition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6d42a84e97b1092e\" href=\"?note=6d42a84e97b1092e\" title=\"72-df-veblen-function\">72-df-veblen-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Local derivation in ZFC; book background Ch.IV §1.1, print210–214; PDF222–226"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-and-argument-reviewed"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\)</span> 为序数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha&lt;\\beta\">\\(\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6d42a84e97b1092e\" href=\"?note=6d42a84e97b1092e\" title=\"72-df-veblen-function\">72-df-veblen-function</a> 的层级。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_\\alpha(\\varphi_\\beta(\\gamma))=\\varphi_\\beta(\\gamma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varphi_\\alpha(\\varphi_\\beta(\\gamma))=\\varphi_\\beta(\\gamma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>由β层定义，其每个值都是所有ξ&lt;β层的公共不动点。取ξ=α即得结论；不需要额外的逐层单调性假设。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-veblen-function","status":"resolved","id":"6d42a84e97b1092e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-veblen-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-veblen-function","status":"resolved","id":"6d42a84e97b1092e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma$ 为序数，$\\alpha<\\beta$；$\\varphi$ 为 [[72-df-veblen-function]] 的层级。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha<\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_\\alpha(\\varphi_\\beta(\\gamma))=\\varphi_\\beta(\\gamma).","display":true}],"bytes":944,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-313","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-veblen-hierarchy|prop-veblen-hierarchy — Veblen Hierarchy Proposition]]"}],"outgoing":["6d42a84e97b1092e"]}